{
  "inShort": "From the devlog and linked media, the playable slice is at risk. No build or five-player findings were shown, so playable progress remains unknown. Mia stopped confirming work and has not stated hours, so the remaining sailing tasks cannot count on her time.",
  "discussed": [
    {
      "itemId": "cmvu35sa101am4gz8x0m11qfx",
      "text": "The inspected repository fulfils the public demo-project reference task. It provides Godot examples, not evidence of this game’s playable slice."
    },
    {
      "itemId": "cmvu35sd201an4gz82vgs6mq3",
      "text": "The animated reference remains done. Inspection reached only the Big Buck Bunny title and thumbnail, so animation could not be verified. Reusing that link in the devlog does not demonstrate the reported second island or reef damage. The accompanying image shows a mountain landscape, not the tide loop."
    },
    {
      "itemId": "cmvu35sg701aq4gz890icklg1",
      "text": "The inspected article fulfils the playtesting-reference task. It explains testing methods, but supplies no findings from five players."
    }
  ],
  "notDiscussed": [
    "cmvu35smi01as4gz8qwek8deq"
  ],
  "outsidePlan": [],
  "questions": [
    "Is there an accessible build demonstrating two islands, the tide loop and two-player sailing?",
    "Did five players test that build, and where are their findings recorded?",
    "What hours can Mia commit to the remaining tasks?"
  ]
}

